code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>For every valid value of <code>char_type</code>, there must be a unique value of <code>int_type</code> distinct from <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/char_traits/eof\">eof()</a></span>.\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/char_traits","title":"std::char_traits"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::char_traits<char>::to_int_type, std::char_traits<wchar_t>::to_int_type, std::char_traits<char8_t>::to_int_type, std::char_traits<char16_t>::to_int_type, std::char_traits<char32_t>::to_int_type","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Converts c to int_type."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A value equivalent to c."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"For every valid value of char_type, there must be a unique value of int_type distinct from eof()."}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":59,"codeBlockCount":0}
